+## R185-C01 — Carrier response validation (approved precision)
+
+Validate the complete CarrierListResponse and every CarrierSummary item before selecting a match.
+CarrierSummary requires carrierId, carrierCode, displayName, status and supportedModes.
+Any required omission or malformed field is 502 DEPENDENCY_RESPONSE_INVALID, never503.
+Duplicate identity or contradiction of the Active filter is502. A valid list with no matching
+identity is404 CARRIER_NOT_FOUND. Empty supportedModes is schema-valid but requested mode
+cannot match:422 CARRIER_MODE_UNSUPPORTED. Shipment's schema-valid optional decision-field
