+## R185-C02 — Exact query scope predicate (approved precision)
+
+At the query-validation stage, inspect each key after exactly one URL query decode.
+ASCII case-insensitive exact keys are tenantId, tenant_id, X-Tenant-Id, legalEntityId,
+legal_entity_id, X-Legal-Entity-Id. Presence alone, including empty values, returns400
+INVALID_REQUEST. Do not recursively decode. Other unknown keys are ignored and never bind
+trusted scope; tenantId[] is not in the set. No general unknown-query rejection is added.
